% expect-output: 60.0
% expect-output: 60.0
% expect-output: 12
% expect-output: 4
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: screens and transfer functions round-trip. setscreen's
% values come back from currentscreen; a screen set inside gsave is
% gone after grestore; setcolorscreen leaves twelve values for
% currentcolorscreen and setcolortransfer four for currentcolortransfer;
% and a transfer function reads back as the procedure given. None of it
% touches the page: the sidecar golden shows the fill alone.
% Expect: 60.0, 60.0, 12, 4, true.
60 45 { pop } setscreen
currentscreen pop pop =
gsave 30 0 { pop } setscreen grestore
currentscreen pop pop =
60 45 { pop } 60 45 { pop } 60 45 { pop } 60 45 { pop } setcolorscreen
currentcolorscreen count = clear
{ } { } { } { } setcolortransfer
currentcolortransfer count = clear
/t { dup mul } def
/t load settransfer currenttransfer /t load eq =
0 0 100 100 rectfill
showpage
